   "record": "984e33ab7c34f01559db4b38e5d42c02c152709e340731d8e0d491084f5ca9b8",
   "status": "DISAGREE",
   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; s2.other is the project's screen for Schedule 2 amounts the tool does not figure (its label lists the ones it does: Schedule SE, Additional Medicare Tax, NIIT and the Form 8889 line 17b tax), so it is true only when one of the named screens is Yes. The reply reads it as 'line 21 above zero', which is true for every return with self-employment tax (the stage14.asset fixtures, a Schedule C with SE tax), giving the 221 value differences in the executable triage (s2.json, this pass). The line changed only by s2.lookback_ask's royalty leg (BUG-1332). Project stands.",
   "subject_key": "acc0340bf556d61475ab1bec9e762ba69579ec9393b709255775e30333a467f8"
  },
